; `cast`, `sizeof` and `alignof` are FORMS whose first argument is a
; type; there is no function behind any of them. Named bare - where a
; value goes - they checked OK and emitted `%cast`, a register nothing
; defines, which llc refused (tests/fuzz/builtin-name-value.axfuzz,
; found by the seeded fuzzer 2026-09-27). Each is AX3013 now, the code
; a missing argument gets everywhere else. The missing-VALUE half,
; `(cast Int)`, is 1019-cast-missing-operand.axbad: the formatter and
; the tree-sitter grammar both refuse that shape, so it cannot be an
; `.ax` file.
(:: g (-> Int Int))
(fn (g x)
  x)

(:: bareCast Int)
(fn (bareCast)
  (g cast))

(:: bareSizeof Int)
(fn (bareSizeof)
  (g sizeof))

(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  (+ (cast Int 1) (sizeof Int)))
